SUMMARY:2026 Fall Semester Student Showcase
LOCATION:Vermont Jazz Center\, 72 Cotton Mill Hill\, Brattleboro\, VT 05301
DESCRIPTION:The Vermont Jazz Center (VJC) invites the community to celebrat
 e the culmination of its fall semester at the Student Showcase on Saturday
 \, December 5\, from 12:00 PM (noon) to 5:00 PM. Over the course of the af
 ternoon\, ten ensembles will share the results of three months of study\, 
 rehearsal\, and collaboration. Listeners can expect a mix of jazz standard
 s\, Latin jazz\, samba percussion\, vocal harmonies\, improvisational fora
 ys and spirited tunes from the Blue Note era.\nhttps://vtjazz.org/calendar
 /2026-fall-semester-student-showcase/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://
 pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://vtjazz.org/calendar/2026-fall-semester-student-showcase/
END:VEVENT
