DESCRIPTION:Grammy Award-winning saxophonist David Sanchez is widely recogn
 ized as one of the most distinguished saxophonists of his generation. Reno
 wned for his unmistakable sound and remarkable command of the instrument\,
  Sánchez brings together a deep understanding on jazz and Latin music wit
 h the rich traditions that shaped both genres. The result is a distinctive
  and compelling musical voice.\nhttps://vtjazz.org/calendar/david-sanchez/
 \nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
